    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10907" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνύ̆-σιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽἀνύὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνυστικός</span>
			, <i>efficacious, effectual,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					716d
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι οὐδὲν -ώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.6.22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				5.178a
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνῠ-ώτατος</span></b>  Pl.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cal.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					39.8
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					144b
				</span></i>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Aphr.<i><span class="en">
				<u>in SE</u>
				164.33
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					518d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>capable of accomplishment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.5.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>VP</u>
				27
			</span></i>, Serapion in <i>Cat.Cod. Astr.</i><i><span class="en">
				1.100
			</span></i>.</div>
